  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Emergency Drought Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to provide a &#x201C;protection ration&#x201D; for the families of acutely malnourished children under five and pregnant women/nursing mothers selected for treatment of moderate or severe acute malnutrition.  This will help: (i) stabilise and improve food and nutrition security of the most vulnerable households; and (ii) reduce sharing within families of expensive specialised nutrition commodities meant only for malnourished members. It is expected that around 60,000 households/360,000 people with malnourished children and/or women will be reached.</narrative>
  </description>
